{"version":1,"content":"<p>《塞爾達：時之笛 重製版》重製版是一次非常出色的重製，它重製的是系列中最優秀的作品之一。不過，很多人在通關後都想知道，這個系列接下來會有什麼動作，無論是新遊戲還是重製版。目前，這兩方面的官方消息都很少。但任天堂Switch 2首次被破解後，數據挖掘得以進行。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586966.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.743129+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:17:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_hash":"a74efd66d88744c7a10546c7fedea2d51ae6e9e5aa63852211395d01bee8bb1a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}